Third-party scripts index.html loads from unpkg, kept here so the
Playwright checks in this folder run with no network at all.

Refresh when the pinned versions in index.html change:

  curl -sS -o leaflet.js   https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js
  curl -sS -o leaflet.css  https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css
  curl -sS -o protomaps-leaflet.js \
       https://unpkg.com/protomaps-leaflet@4.0.1/dist/protomaps-leaflet.js
